Tengo que acabar los Channels i los Servers.

Servers --> Hacer el parseo de todos los comandos (PASS (check if irc server was launched with a password), NICK, USER, JOIN, PRIVMSG)

Orden de connexion PASS --> NICK/USER

Si NICK/USER antes de PASS, error.

PASS:
    PASS [password]
Nick:
    NICK [nickname] --> Changes the user's nickname. If a registered user changes their nickname, it gets broadcastedd.

User:
    USER [username] [mode(0)] *(unused) : [realName (can have spaces)]

JOIN:
    JOIN #42 --> Joins channel 42, or creates it if it doesnt exist. If they create it, they become operator.

PRIVMSG:
    Se puede hacer a un canal (PRIVMSG #canal) o a un user (PRIVMSG nick)



:alice!user@host JOIN #general

:Prefix (identifica quien ha enviado el mensaje)

alice --> nickname

user --> Username

host --> IP address (SE consige del accept)



Channels:

    Join makes users join/create a channel. IF they create it, they are operators.
    Para enviar un mensaje a un channel, se tiene que ser parte del channel y usar PRIVMSG #nchannel
    Los operadores pueden usar
        KICK / INVITE [nick]
        MODE:
            i --> Add / delete invite only mode
            t --> PUt / remove restriction on TOPIC command to only channel admins
            k --> Add /remove channel key
            o --> Give / take operator privilige
            l --> Add / remove user limit




